    "overview": "TechConnect Seattle is a non-profit organization that aims to provide free technology training to individuals in underserved populations, focusing on enhancing digital literacy, fostering employability, and equipping individuals with the skills to thrive in a digital world. Following initial establishment in Seattle/King County, TechConnect plans to expand its operations internationally.",
    "objectives": [
      "Train 1,000 individuals in digital skills within the first year.",
