    {
      "section": "Email Marketing",
      "content": "Email marketing remains one of the most effective online marketing strategies. It allows you to communicate directly with your audience, providing updates, promotions, and personalized content. Build your list, segment your audience, and regularly test different subject lines, content, and send times."
    },
